{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You wake in an empty tower.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A crumpled note in your pocket reads:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u201cSorry we drugged you. Find me before night falls\u2026\u201d</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of <i>Kaelthar</i>\u2014a land full of magic, adventure, and amazing powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path: pick your race, your class, and exciting quests to go on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own hero with special skills, cool weapons, and powerful magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use swords, spells, or potions to fight monsters and protect the world from danger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A part of you feel this is a Cool game, and you want to buy it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are some of the Important enemies, you have to fight..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/extras/dc422c85dc699e73bf31a74ebed112c8.poster.avif?t=1762855436\" width=540 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/extras/dc422c85dc699e73bf31a74ebed112c8.webm?t=1762855436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/extras/dc422c85dc699e73bf31a74ebed112c8.mp4?t=1762855436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>An Awesome Open-World RPG filled with Unique Demons and Powerful Dragons.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices Matter</strong> in this funny Sandbox type RPG, where you can take many different paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong> is easy, with many different weapons, (Some you can make yourself), Many different colors for clothes, hats and armor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting your own Sword and improve your armor, and customize your clothes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RTwP = Real time combat, with Pause. You can pause the battle, to use healing potions, change weapons or even change options.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic in this game is easy and wild\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features things like crafting:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sword Crafting</strong>, where you can create your own sword from +250,000 Unique combinations. Swords and Armors can also be Improved with smiting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alchemy Crafting</strong>, with over 100,000 possible combinations to make a wide variety of potions. A cheap way to make money.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spell Crafting</strong>, with over a million ways to combine spells\u2014from a simple fireball to a lightning storm that covers the whole map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enchanting:</strong> Make your character Unique with his own enchantments on weapons, Armour and Jewellery. Buy them in the many shops, or make them yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the RuneChild RPG. <br>You can play it casually\u2014taking your time to explore the world and complete quests\u2014or go full hardcore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s also a <strong>Fight Arena</strong> for players who want to dive straight into the action and face demons, monsters, and dragons with nothing but a simple sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between\u00a0<strong>Fighter, Ranger,\u00a0Rogue,</strong> or <strong>Wizard</strong>, each with their own strengths and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I love playing open-world RPGs like <i>Skyrim</i>, <i>Oblivion</i>, and <i>Morrowind</i>, as well as exploring Tolkien\u2019s 'Lord of the Rings' universe. So, I\u2019ve taken the parts I enjoy most from them: the wild magic and alchemy from <i>Morrowind</i>, the bright colors of <i>Oblivion</i>, and <i>Skyrim</i>\u2019s weapon improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So if you like skyrim, or if you like morrowind, then try this game.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Visit_WolfShire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/8ab1d9b80b192bcbc4c9969296bbe16671b255d2.jpg"},{"name":"VisitMossField","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/6cbb0ffd749d6aba9584fe6fe0865ca84eaba61d.jpg"},{"name":"Row Your Boat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/92639f450cb82409d0c5a64cf9b4ae1bf4c0cb9d.jpg"},{"name":"Just 5 more Minutes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/3a7785567e03485d6876e6afaef86ef60900311e.jpg"},{"name":"Sitting Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/8e4d14c74ee149305c88f94d26aed06e87fa780f.jpg"},{"name":"Riding a Mount ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/ebe620fe91c50b33e755e447bf278e6f18292d23.jpg"},{"name":"Killed a Golden Spider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/7a5687da4fccbf7e85d8d3f76e063173d512bd94.jpg"},{"name":"Open First Page","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/5ce8ac95a57d96b9c86f823df22598a352477ec2.jpg"},{"name":"Start as Human","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/7b867e2a2f71a16b432213fd9ec67697da8e190a.jpg"},{"name":"Start as Hafling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/9d7f8d101b15ef95000aab798cf78b003c7a8825.jpg"}],"total":67},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1078610?t=1762855436","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/40347d60a0726995e6de010f59d2753cdada74b4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762855436","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/4a6f4ae1c57cc78549dd7598b61a54e7efa186c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762855436","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/4a6f4ae1c57cc78549dd7598b61a54e7efa186c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762855436","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2614440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You wake in an empty tower.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A crumpled note in your pocket reads:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u201cSorry we drugged you. Find me before night falls\u2026\u201d</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of <i>Kaelthar</i>\u2014a land full of magic, adventure, and amazing powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path: pick your race, your class, and exciting quests to go on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own hero with special skills, cool weapons, and powerful magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use swords, spells, or potions to fight monsters and protect the world from danger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A part of you feel this is a Cool game, and you want to buy it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are some of the Important enemies, you have to fight..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/extras/dc422c85dc699e73bf31a74ebed112c8.poster.avif?t=1762855436\" width=540 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/extras/dc422c85dc699e73bf31a74ebed112c8.webm?t=1762855436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/extras/dc422c85dc699e73bf31a74ebed112c8.mp4?t=1762855436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>An Awesome Open-World RPG filled with Unique Demons and Powerful Dragons.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices Matter</strong> in this funny Sandbox type RPG, where you can take many different paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong> is easy, with many different weapons, (Some you can make yourself), Many different colors for clothes, hats and armor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting your own Sword and improve your armor, and customize your clothes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RTwP = Real time combat, with Pause. You can pause the battle, to use healing potions, change weapons or even change options.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic in this game is easy and wild\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features things like crafting:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sword Crafting</strong>, where you can create your own sword from +250,000 Unique combinations. Swords and Armors can also be Improved with smiting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alchemy Crafting</strong>, with over 100,000 possible combinations to make a wide variety of potions. A cheap way to make money.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spell Crafting</strong>, with over a million ways to combine spells\u2014from a simple fireball to a lightning storm that covers the whole map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enchanting:</strong> Make your character Unique with his own enchantments on weapons, Armour and Jewellery. Buy them in the many shops, or make them yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the RuneChild RPG. <br>You can play it casually\u2014taking your time to explore the world and complete quests\u2014or go full hardcore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s also a <strong>Fight Arena</strong> for players who want to dive straight into the action and face demons, monsters, and dragons with nothing but a simple sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between\u00a0<strong>Fighter, Ranger,\u00a0Rogue,</strong> or <strong>Wizard</strong>, each with their own strengths and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I love playing open-world RPGs like <i>Skyrim</i>, <i>Oblivion</i>, and <i>Morrowind</i>, as well as exploring Tolkien\u2019s 'Lord of the Rings' universe. So, I\u2019ve taken the parts I enjoy most from them: the wild magic and alchemy from <i>Morrowind</i>, the bright colors of <i>Oblivion</i>, and <i>Skyrim</i>\u2019s weapon improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So if you like skyrim, or if you like morrowind, then try this game.</p>","developers":["J. C. SpringBourne"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/974aadb34583442b03af9ecc54bb1d54289b1984/header.jpg?t=1762855436","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1078610/1909503088/ec5a43ee58d964978b9c3ac4bacb14462a8cb66d/1762854843/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762855435","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1078610/1909503088/ec5a43ee58d964978b9c3ac4bacb14462a8cb66d/1762854843/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762855435","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1078610/1909503088/ec5a43ee58d964978b9c3ac4bacb14462a8cb66d/1762854843/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762855435","id":257229492,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257229492/movie480.mp4?t=1762855435","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257229492/movie_max.mp4?t=1762855435"},"name":"character customization","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257229492/3e361ba348219de87df21165cc141544b8fc23dd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762855435","webm